OL,3,GNEWSARoad closure fears for shops and
OL,4,Ahospital access
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have said they are "angry and
OL,7,Fupset" about a five-week road closure
OL,8,Famid fears it will hit businesses and
OL,9,Fblock access to a local hospital.
OL,11,FBeth Ainsworth, who runs a shop in the
OL,12,FCotswolds town of Tetbury, said the
OL,13,Fclosure of Silver Street would have a
OL,14,Fnegative impact on her business in the
OL,15,Frun-up to Christmas.
OL,17,F"I don't believe I've met a single
OL,18,Fperson who wants this to go ahead," she
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
