OL,3,GNEWSARoad closure fears for shops and
OL,4,Ahospital access
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Mark Harris said
OL,7,FGloucestershire County Council
OL,8,F"understands the concerns raised and
OL,9,Fhas been working closely with
OL,10,Fresidents, businesses and Tetbury
OL,11,FHospital to minimise disruption where
OL,12,Fpossible".
